## 2. Cast

> Guidance: 5–7 recurring people **across the register ladder** in `protocol/language.md`
> (an elder to address up to, peers to banter across with, a child who tolerates every
> error and cannot switch languages to be kind). For each: relation, age, and what they are
> *for* as a listening instrument — older forms, terseness, speed, swallowed endings. Pin
> one real voice each: setup lists the provider's voices for the language first and never
> guesses an ID. Give the eavesdrop role to one cast member and pin `tts.eavesdrop_voice` to
> the same voice. Also name the two Breakdown analysts (`protocol/studio/hosts.md`).

One-offs rotate through freely — a conductor, a seller, a wrong number — and are never canon.
**Each voice is pinned**: the ear tracks a speaker before it tracks a word.
**Every name carries its target-language form**: an overheard tape must name who it is about
in its opening, and the tape is in the target language.

